  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "This lesson introduces expressions for telling time in Spanish. The question *¿Qué hora es?* asks for the time, and answers use the verb *ser* with the definite article: *Es la una* for one o’clock and *Son las dos* for two o’clock. Minutes are added with *y* (and) or expressed as minutes before the hour using *menos* (e.g., *Son las doce menos tres* – it’s three minutes to twelve)."
    }
